# clamber-scenario v1
#
# A whole run through the first level, from the start to the goal,
# without losing a life, on the classic-1 preset: the bundled game's
# starting preset. The playthrough test (crates/sim/tests/playthrough.rs)
# plays it so CI proves the level stays completable on it. If a change to
# the level or to movement breaks it, find a new run with
# crates/sim/examples/find_run.rs (beam width 1000, preset classic-1).
id: first-level
summary: Play the first level from the start to the goal on classic-1
requires: content/base/levels/first.level
start: the level's start, lead character, classic-1 preset
frames: 4469

